2
00:00:02.337 --> 00:00:06.475
Chapter 31, from the Architect part of the System Design Playbook.

3
00:00:08.225 --> 00:00:09.185
At a glance:

4
00:00:09.465 --> 00:00:10.639
Chapter at a glance.

5
