65
00:05:28.129 --> 00:05:29.707
Sensitivity analysis.

66
00:05:29.987 --> 00:05:31.609
Grocery platform usage:

67
00:05:31.889 --> 00:05:34.662
Every scored decision states which weight would flip it.

68
00:05:34.942 --> 00:05:35.625
