Lab:

78
00:05:56.003 --> 00:05:56.835
L2.

79
00:05:57.115 --> 00:05:58.651
Quantitative validation.

80
00:05:58.931 --> 00:06:00.553
Grocery platform usage:

81
00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:04.523
Capacity or latency models before committing to a design.

82
00:06:04.803 --> 00:06:05.486
Lab:

83
00:06:05.766 --> 00:06:06.619
