00:31:41.441 --> 00:31:59.617
Criteria or weights: time-to-market=3 scalability=2 operability=2. cost-at-current-scale=2 team-fit=3 evolvability=2. option raw scores (ttm or scale or ops or cost or team or evolve) weighted.

387
00:31:59.897 --> 00:32:04.804
Modular Monolith 5, 3, 5, 5, 5, 4 4.57.

388
00:32:05.084 --> 00:32:09.265
Microservices 2, 5, 2, 2, 2, 5 2.86.

389
00:32:09.545 --> 00:32:15.241
Serverless (FaaS) 4, 5, 3, 4, 3, 3 3.64. then base winner:

390
00:32:15.521 --> 00:32:21.260
Modular Monolith (4.57). sensitivity A, scalability weight 2, then 6:

391
00:32:21.540 --> 00:32:23.652
Modular Monolith 4.22.

392
00:32:23.932 --> 00:32:26.151
Microservices 3.33.

393
00:32:26.431 --> 00:32:27.945
The rest is in the chapter.

394
00:32:30.795 --> 00:32:31.649
Reading it:

395
00:32:31.929 --> 00:32:41.998
The Modular Monolith wins at 4.57 because this team, at this stage, weights time-to-market and team-fit highest, and the monolith scores 5 on both.

396
00:32:42.278 --> 00:32:47.249
Sensitivity A: tripling the scalability weight (2, then 6) doesn't change the winner.

397
00:32:47.529 --> 00:32:51.433
