398
00:32:51.713 --> 00:32:57.302
That second fact is a surprise a monolith versus microservices framing would have missed.

399
00:32:58.652 --> 00:33:04.113
Sensitivity B: five of six criteria can't flip the winner anywhere in 0, 12.

400
00:33:04.393 --> 00:33:13.268
Only scalability can, at about 8.75, that is, valuing scalability roughly as much as every other criterion combined.

401
00:33:13.548 --> 00:33:14.977
That's a robust decision.

402
00:33:15.257 --> 00:33:27.225
The ADR therefore records not just monolith but monolith, robust to normal weight disagreement; revisit if scalability becomes the dominant driver, a quantified revisit trigger.

